{"data": {"msg": "Elementary: --ELEMENTARY-MACRO-OUTPUT-START--[{\"name\": \"scraping_targets_int_fbref_keeper\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.scraping_targets_int_fbref_keeper\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"audits\", \"table_name\": \"scraping_targets_int_fbref_keeper\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Liste des (team, season) \\u00e0 rescraper : lignes de silver.fbref_keeper o\\u00f9 ga_keeper > sota (violation physique). Vue mise \\u00e0 jour \\u00e0 chaque `dbt run`.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"view\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\audits\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\audits\\\\scraping_targets_int_fbref_keeper.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"scraping_targets_int_fbref_shooting\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.scraping_targets_int_fbref_shooting\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"audits\", \"table_name\": \"scraping_targets_int_fbref_shooting\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Liste des (team, season) \\u00e0 rescraper : lignes de silver.fbref_shooting o\\u00f9 standard_gls > standard_sot OU standard_gls > gf (violations physiques A-011). Vue mise \\u00e0 jour \\u00e0 chaque `dbt run`.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"view\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\audits\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\audits\\\\scraping_targets_int_fbref_shooting.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"equipe_adversaire_match\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.equipe_adversaire_match\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"equipe_adversaire_match\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": null, \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\equipe_adversaire_match.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"equipe_confrontation_match\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.equipe_confrontation_match\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"equipe_confrontation_match\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": null, \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\equipe_confrontation_match.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"equipe_confrontation_zone\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.equipe_confrontation_zone\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"equipe_confrontation_zone\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Confrontations zonales pivot\\u00e9es au grain (match_id, team_id) : perspective offensive + d\\u00e9fensive par couloir. Consomm\\u00e9 par les marts.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\gold\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\equipe_confrontation_zone.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"equipe_gardien_match\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.equipe_gardien_match\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"equipe_gardien_match\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Profil de saison d\\u00e9cal\\u00e9 du gardien titulaire rattach\\u00e9 \\u00e0 l'\\u00e9quipe \\u2014 grain (match_id, team_id). Cl\\u00e9s NULL r\\u00e9siduelles = compos manquantes (scraping 2025-26), trac\\u00e9es en warn le temps de compl\\u00e9ter la couverture.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\gold\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\equipe_gardien_match.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"equipe_lineup_match\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.equipe_lineup_match\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"equipe_lineup_match\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": null, \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\equipe_lineup_match.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"equipe_match\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.equipe_match\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"equipe_match\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": null, \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\equipe_match.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"gardien_saison\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.gardien_saison\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"gardien_saison\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": null, \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\gardien_saison.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"joueur_match\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.joueur_match\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"joueur_match\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": null, \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\joueur_match.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"joueur_saison\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.joueur_saison\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"joueur_saison\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": null, \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\joueur_saison.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"joueur_zone_saison\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.joueur_zone_saison\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"joueur_zone_saison\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": null, \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\joueur_zone_saison.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"rolling_corners\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.rolling_corners\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"rolling_corners\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Rolling windows W=3/5/10 sur les corners, depuis intermediate.corner_profiles. 1 ligne par \\u00e9quipe par match \\u2014 \\\"for\\\" (corners obtenus) et \\\"against\\\" (corners conc\\u00e9d\\u00e9s), jointes via intermediate.backbone (team_id / opponent_id). Action dangereuse = corner ayant produit un tir (outcome IN goal/shot_saved/ shot_off_target). Ratio de sommes sur la fen\\u00eatre, pas moyenne de taux par match. Enrichi (Vague 5.4) : intensite de danger continue (xG/corner), profil aerien (tetes sur tirs/buts), tendance corner court, et bataille du degagement defensif.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\gold\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\rolling_corners.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"rolling_freekicks\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.rolling_freekicks\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"rolling_freekicks\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Rolling windows W=3/5/10 sur les coups francs, depuis intermediate.freekick_profiles. 1 ligne par \\u00e9quipe par match \\u2014 \\\"for\\\" (coups francs obtenus) et \\\"against\\\" (conc\\u00e9d\\u00e9s), jointes via intermediate.backbone (team_id / opponent_id). Filtr\\u00e9 sur fk_zone_type IN (crossed, direct_shot) : les coups francs too_far/own_box sont exclus, ils n'ont pas de danger r\\u00e9el et diluent le signal. Action dangereuse = coup franc ayant produit un tir. Ratio de sommes sur la fen\\u00eatre, pas moyenne de taux par match. Enrichi (Vague 5.4) : intensit\\u00e9 de danger continue, profil a\\u00e9rien, bataille du d\\u00e9gagement, r\\u00e9partition tactique par zone (direct/crossed/own_box/too_far, non filtr\\u00e9e) et qualit\\u00e9 de position (distance/angle) des coups francs directs.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\gold\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\rolling_freekicks.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"team_corridor_profile\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.team_corridor_profile\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"team_corridor_profile\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": null, \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\team_corridor_profile.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"zone_confrontation_match\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.zone_confrontation_match\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"zone_confrontation_match\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": null, \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\zone_confrontation_match.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"backbone\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.backbone\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"backbone\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Table pivot centrale \\u2014 1 ligne par \\u00e9quipe par match (base int_fbref_schedule, matchs \\u00e0 venir inclus). Jointure des int_fbref_* (schedule, keeper, shooting, misc), int_understat_stats et int_odds, produite par dbt en mode incremental. Uniquement des faits au grain match : les agr\\u00e9gats de saison WhoScored (grain \\u00e9quipe \\u00d7 saison) sont joints en gold, d\\u00e9cal\\u00e9s en N-1 (cf. gold.equipe_match). Sch\\u00e9ma intermediate \\u2014 consomm\\u00e9e par les mod\\u00e8les gold.* et marts.*. Noms de colonnes pr\\u00e9fix\\u00e9s par type (docs/proposition_nommage_definitif.csv) ; premier run apr\\u00e8s la refonte en --full-refresh.\\nSegmentation Big5-only : - Colonnes Understat (dec_np_xg, dec_ppda, dec_np_xg_diff_match) : 100 % NULL hors Big5 - Colonnes Odds : 100 % NULL hors Big5, avec sparsit\\u00e9 r\\u00e9siduelle en Big5\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\backbone.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"corner_profiles\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.corner_profiles\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"corner_profiles\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Profils de corners. Pour chaque cha\\u00eene d\\u00e9clench\\u00e9e par un corner, caract\\u00e9rise la livraison (end_x/end_y, joueur, via qualifier CornerTaken=6) et l'issue de la s\\u00e9quence. Source : player_possession_chains. Incr\\u00e9mentale.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\corner_profiles.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"event_values\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.event_values\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"event_values\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Valorise chaque \\u00e9v\\u00e9nement individuel via cinq axes ind\\u00e9pendants (danger_position, chance_creation, def_execution_quality, pressure_context, context_weight) combin\\u00e9s en une note globale action_value. Couche \\\"value par action\\\" consomm\\u00e9e par les mod\\u00e8les de cha\\u00eenes. Source : int_event_enriched. Incr\\u00e9mentale (cl\\u00e9 match_id + team_id + player_id + row_num).\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\event_values.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"freekick_profiles\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.freekick_profiles\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"freekick_profiles\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Profils de coups francs par cha\\u00eene. Caract\\u00e9rise chaque coup franc par son type (direct, indirect, short_pass) et son issue (goal, shot_saved, shot_off_target, offside, foul_won, corner_won, open_play, turnover). Source : player_possession_chains. Incr\\u00e9mentale.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\freekick_profiles.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"h2h_history\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.h2h_history\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"h2h_history\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Registre brut des confrontations directes entre \\u00e9quipes. Une ligne par match.\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\h2h_history.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_defensive_blocks\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_defensive_blocks\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_defensive_blocks\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Contres d\\u00e9fensifs au grain \\u00ab un contre \\u00bb, avec le d\\u00e9fenseur qui bloque. Bas\\u00e9 sur l'event type 74 BlockedPass (bloqueur toujours nomm\\u00e9), rattach\\u00e9 \\u00e0 la passe bloqu\\u00e9e via le qual 233 (99,4 %). Ce sont des contres de PASSE ; les contres de tir n'ont pas de bloqueur nomm\\u00e9 chez Opta et sont hors p\\u00e9rim\\u00e8tre. Le join qual 233 contraint l'\\u00e9quipe adverse (event_id scop\\u00e9 par \\u00e9quipe). Source : int_whoscored_events, events_qual.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_defensive_blocks.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_fbref_keeper\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_fbref_keeper\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_fbref_keeper\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Stats gardien FBref (tirs cadr\\u00e9s subis, arr\\u00eats, save%) rematch\\u00e9es sur match_id unifi\\u00e9 et team_id normalis\\u00e9. Colonnes num\\u00e9riques cast\\u00e9es et corrig\\u00e9es depuis le VARCHAR brut : identit\\u00e9 sota = ga_keeper + saves appliqu\\u00e9e quand une seule des trois manque, saves = 0 par convention quand absent, NULL uniquement quand les trois manquent ensemble (~0.4%).\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_fbref_keeper.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_fbref_misc\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_fbref_misc\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_fbref_misc\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Stats disciplinaires et d\\u00e9fensives FBref (cartons, fautes, hors-jeux, centres, interceptions, tacles gagn\\u00e9s, penaltys obtenus/conc\\u00e9d\\u00e9s, CSC) rematch\\u00e9es sur match_id + team_id. Alimente le bloc disciplinaire de backbone. Colonnes cast\\u00e9es depuis le VARCHAR brut de silver.fbref_misc. Stats avanc\\u00e9es (fls, fld, off, crosses, int, tklw) absentes avant 2014-2015 (~24 900 lignes NULL) ; faux z\\u00e9ros FBref neutralis\\u00e9s en NULL (bloc complet 616 lignes, sous-bloc int/tklw). pkwon/pkcon fournis par FBref uniquement de 2014-2015 \\u00e0 2018-2019 (~78 % NULL).\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_fbref_misc.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_fbref_schedule\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_fbref_schedule\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_fbref_schedule\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Feuille de match FBref (r\\u00e9sultat, buts marqu\\u00e9s/encaiss\\u00e9s, possession, formation) rematch\\u00e9e sur match_id + team_id. Source des r\\u00e9sultats bruts et de la possession dans backbone. Couvre toutes les comp\\u00e9titions (Big5, Cup, D2, Europe, Other) \\u2014 pas de segmentation Big5-only. Inclut les matchs non jou\\u00e9s (\\u00e0 venir, report\\u00e9s, annul\\u00e9s COVID 2019-20) : str_result = '', int_gf / int_ga / str_result_1n2 NULL (4 278 lignes).\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_fbref_schedule.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_fbref_shooting\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_fbref_shooting\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_fbref_shooting\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Volume de tirs FBref (tirs totaux, tirs cadr\\u00e9s, ratios d'efficacit\\u00e9) rematch\\u00e9 sur match_id + team_id. Alimente le bloc tirs de backbone. Colonnes cast\\u00e9es depuis le VARCHAR brut de silver.fbref_shooting. Pas de donn\\u00e9es de tirs FBref avant 2014-2015 (19 900 lignes : sh, sot, pkatt et ratios NULL). sh = 0 trait\\u00e9 comme donn\\u00e9e manquante (563 lignes \\u2192 NULL). Ratios recalcul\\u00e9s hors penalty, \\u00e9chelle 0-1.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_fbref_shooting.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_formation_matchup_match\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_formation_matchup_match\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_formation_matchup_match\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Grain (match_id, team_id) directionnel A\\u2192B. Deltas structurels entre la formation de A et celle de l'adversaire B (attack_overload, mid_control_delta, back_depth_delta, width_delta, depth_delta, axiality_delta) + cl\\u00e9 cat\\u00e9gorielle crois\\u00e9e matchup_family (ex. '4-back_vs_3-back'). Compl\\u00e8te le signal individuel d'int_lineup_formation par les effets non-lin\\u00e9aires de matchup formation \\u00d7 formation.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_formation_matchup_match.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_fouls_drawn\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_fouls_drawn\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_fouls_drawn\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Fautes subies (coups francs obtenus) au grain \\u00ab une faute subie \\u00bb : c\\u00f4t\\u00e9 outcome_id=1 des events Foul (type 4). Rattache le fautif via le qual 233 (OppositeRelatedEvent, d\\u00e9terministe 100 %), la localisation (x/y, zone), le tiers offensif (x > 66.7) et si la faute donne un penalty. Le joueur qui subit est NULL ~5 % (limite source). Source : int_whoscored_events, events_qual.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_fouls_drawn.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_keeper_psxg\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_keeper_psxg\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_keeper_psxg\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Post-Shot Expected Goals +/- (PSxG+/-) par gardien = mesure de shot-stopping. Grain : gardien \\u00d7 saison \\u00d7 championnat. Source : int_keeper_shots. psxg_plus_minus = \\u03a3 xGOT subi \\u2212 buts encaiss\\u00e9s ; > 0 = le gardien arr\\u00eate plus que la qualit\\u00e9 des tirs ne le pr\\u00e9dit (surperformance). Garde-fou sym\\u00e9trique : uniquement les tirs des matchs o\\u00f9 def_gk_available (pas d'arr\\u00eat sans but possible). Hors CSC/penalty par construction amont. Mat\\u00e9rialis\\u00e9 en table.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_keeper_psxg.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_keeper_shots\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_keeper_shots\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_keeper_shots\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Attribution du gardien \\u00e0 chaque tir cadr\\u00e9 subi \\u2014 brique de int_keeper_psxg. Grain : un tir cadr\\u00e9 (SavedShot + Goal, hors CSC/penalty), avec son xGOT (machine_learning.xgot_predictions) et le gardien qui l'a subi. Deux voies : tirs arr\\u00eat\\u00e9s \\u2192 Save miroir reli\\u00e9 au tir par le qualifier 233 (related_event_id est NULL) ; buts \\u2192 GK (slot=1) de l'\\u00e9quipe qui d\\u00e9fend, p\\u00e9riode de formation active. keeper_id = COALESCE(save, lineup). Mat\\u00e9rialis\\u00e9 en table.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_keeper_shots.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_lineup_formation\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_lineup_formation\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_lineup_formation\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Grain (match_id, team_id). Features structurelles de la compo de d\\u00e9part (p\\u00e9riode 1) : compteurs par ligne via role_fin_resolved, cat\\u00e9gorie 3/4/5-back via n_def, \\u00e9cart-type spatial du bloc de champ (GK exclu), hauteur moyenne des lignes d\\u00e9fensive/offensive, axialit\\u00e9 du XI. Base de la Phase 4 (features formation) \\u2014 consomm\\u00e9 par int_formation_matchup_match et par equipe_lineup_match.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_lineup_formation.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_odds\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_odds\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_odds\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Cotes bookmakers (Pinnacle et moyennes march\\u00e9) rematch\\u00e9es sur match_id + team_id/opponent_id. Alimente les colonnes odds_* et les probabilit\\u00e9s implicites de backbone.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_odds.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_penalties\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_penalties\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_penalties\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Penaltys au grain \\u00ab un penalty tir\\u00e9 \\u00bb. Pivot = la frappe (types 13/14/15/16 portant qual 9) : tireur, r\\u00e9sultat (marqu\\u00e9/arr\\u00eat\\u00e9/poteau/hors-cadre) et placement (goal_mouth_*). Rattach\\u00e9s en LEFT JOIN : PenaltyFaced (type 58, m\\u00eame instant) \\u2192 \\u00e9quipe qui d\\u00e9fend + gardien ; le foul en double (type 4 + qual 9) \\u2192 joueur qui obtient / conc\\u00e8de, dans une fen\\u00eatre de 300 s avant la frappe. Sources : int_event_enriched, int_whoscored_events, events_qual.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_penalties.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_player_minutes\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_player_minutes\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_player_minutes\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Minutes jou\\u00e9es par joueur et par match, d\\u00e9riv\\u00e9es de la timeline de formation WhoScored (int_whoscored_lineup) \\u2014 \\u03a3 des dur\\u00e9es de segments, minutes expanded (absolues). Base du per-90 en couche Gold. Garde-fous : match_id non NULL (exclut les orphelins D2), segments born\\u00e9s 0..130 (exclut la sentinelle 32767), GREATEST(end-start,0).\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_player_minutes.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_player_role_lag\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_player_role_lag\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_player_role_lag\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Grain (player_id, season). R\\u00f4le tactique dominant du joueur en saison N-1 (SEASON-LAG), calcul\\u00e9 sur ses apparitions comme titulaire (moyenne pond\\u00e9r\\u00e9e par minutes titu de grid_vertical/grid_horizontal, taxonomie 9 : GK, CB, FB, DM, CM, WM, AM, W, ST). NULL possible pour une recrue \\u2192 fallback dans int_player_role_match via role_fin_current.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_player_role_lag.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_player_role_match\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_player_role_match\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_player_role_match\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Grain (match_id, player_id). R\\u00f4le tactique r\\u00e9solu pour le match, cascade : role_fin_lag (SEASON-LAG) \\u2192 role_fin_current (slot du joueur dans la formation initiale de ce match, coord annonc\\u00e9e pr\\u00e9-match, pas de leakage) \\u2192 role_fin_resolved = COALESCE des deux, JAMAIS NULL pour un titulaire. Consomm\\u00e9e par le KNN (famille 11 refonte) et serve_features.py.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_player_role_match.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_player_zone_season\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_player_zone_season\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_player_zone_season\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Agr\\u00e9gat zonal 5\\u00d75 offensif par (joueur, cellule, saison jou\\u00e9e) : part moyenne des touches (grille pct_zX_cY remise en tall) et tirs pris dans la cellule (int_shot_placement binn\\u00e9, CSC exclus). Base de gold.joueur_zone_saison. Scind\\u00e9 + mat\\u00e9rialis\\u00e9 pour contourner un bug du planner DuckDB 1.5.1.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_player_zone_season.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_progressive_carries\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_progressive_carries\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_progressive_carries\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Conduites (dribbles) au grain \\u00ab un dribble r\\u00e9ussi \\u00bb : TakeOn (type 3) r\\u00e9ussis c\\u00f4t\\u00e9 offensif (outcome 1 + qual 286). WhoScored n'a pas d'event carry ; le TakeOn est la seule conduite balle au pied enregistr\\u00e9e. Progression mesur\\u00e9e du dribble jusqu'\\u00e0 la touche suivante du joueur dans la m\\u00eame cha\\u00eene, en m\\u00e8tres (r\\u00e9duction de distance au but). is_progressive = gain \\u2265 5 m. Source : player_possession_chains, events_qual.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_progressive_carries.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_shot_creating_actions\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_shot_creating_actions\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_shot_creating_actions\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Actions cr\\u00e9atrices de tir (SCA) et de but (GCA), standard FBref/StatsBomb. Une ligne par cr\\u00e9dit = (tir, sca_order 1|2) : les 2 actions offensives de l'\\u00e9quipe qui tire, dans la m\\u00eame cha\\u00eene de possession, juste avant le tir (Pass, TakeOn, faute obtenue, tir/rebond). is_gca vrai si le tir est un but. Source : player_possession_chains.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_shot_creating_actions.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_shot_placement\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_shot_placement\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_shot_placement\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Placement de tir au grain \\u00ab un tir \\u00bb \\u2014 base du Post-Shot xG (xGOT). Tirs (types 13/14/15/16) issus de int_event_enriched, avec la g\\u00e9om\\u00e9trie du placement dans le cadre du but (goal_mouth_y/z) d\\u00e9riv\\u00e9e pour les tirs cadr\\u00e9s : zone 3\\u00d73, \\u00e9cart au centre, hauteur, distance normalis\\u00e9e \\u00e0 la lucarne. Le xGOT entra\\u00een\\u00e9 reste en aval ; ce mod\\u00e8le expose les entr\\u00e9es + un xG pr\\u00e9-tir proxy. Sources : int_event_enriched, event_values.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_shot_placement.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_substitutions\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_substitutions\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_substitutions\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Changements au grain \\u00ab un remplacement \\u00bb : joueur qui sort (SubstitutionOff, type 18) appari\\u00e9 \\u00e0 celui qui entre (SubstitutionOn, type 19) par rang au sein du groupe (match, \\u00e9quipe, minute, seconde) \\u2014 g\\u00e8re les changements simultan\\u00e9s. Crois\\u00e9 avec related_player_id (pr\\u00e9sent 27 %) : concordance 99,8 %. sub_number = k-i\\u00e8me changement de l'\\u00e9quipe. Source : int_whoscored_events.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_substitutions.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_understat_schedule\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_understat_schedule\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_understat_schedule\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Calendrier Understat rematch\\u00e9 sur le match_id unifi\\u00e9. 1 ligne par match (point de vue domicile : str_team_id = domicile, str_opponent_id = ext\\u00e9rieur). Conserve str_us_match_id (id Understat d'origine) et produit la correspondance str_us_match_id \\u2194 str_match_id r\\u00e9utilis\\u00e9e par int_understat_stats. P\\u00e9rim\\u00e8tre : Big5 domestique, 2014-2015 \\u2192 2025-2026. Understat ne fournit pas de date : jointure registre sur (saison, championnat, domicile, ext\\u00e9rieur), en retenant la premi\\u00e8re date de la paire (\\u00e9carte les barrages class\\u00e9s dans le m\\u00eame league_source, ex. Spezia-Verona 11/06/2023).\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_understat_schedule.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_understat_stats\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_understat_stats\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_understat_stats\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Stats Understat par match jou\\u00e9 (xPts, npxG, PPDA, deep) rattach\\u00e9es au match_id unifi\\u00e9 via int_understat_schedule (1-1 sur str_us_match_id). Alimente les colonnes xG et pressing de backbone. P\\u00e9rim\\u00e8tre : Big5 domestique. 21 259 lignes = matchs jou\\u00e9s.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_understat_stats.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_whoscored_formations\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_whoscored_formations\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_whoscored_formations\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Timeline tactique par \\u00e9quipe par match, identit\\u00e9s normalis\\u00e9es (team_id canonique + match_id unifi\\u00e9 via int_whoscored_match_index). formation_id reste la cl\\u00e9 vers silver.stg_whoscored_formations_ref. Source : silver.stg_whoscored_formations.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_whoscored_formations.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_whoscored_lineup\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_whoscored_lineup\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_whoscored_lineup\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Composition positionnelle par p\\u00e9riode de formation \\u2014 grain (match \\u00d7 \\u00e9quipe \\u00d7 formation_seq \\u00d7 joueur), une ligne par titulaire (slot 1..11). La position est r\\u00e9cup\\u00e9r\\u00e9e via le slot du joueur (formation_positions[slot]), pas par alignement d'index : robuste aux trous de slot (carton rouge). Identit\\u00e9s normalis\\u00e9es (team_id canonique + match_id unifi\\u00e9 via int_whoscored_match_index). Source : silver.stg_whoscored_formations (pr\\u00e9requis : formation_slots rempli).\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_whoscored_lineup.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_whoscored_lineup_agg\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_whoscored_lineup_agg\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_whoscored_lineup_agg\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Features positionnelles au grain joueur\\u00d7match, agr\\u00e9g\\u00e9es depuis int_whoscored_lineup : position moyenne pond\\u00e9r\\u00e9e par les minutes, slot principal, capitaine, nombre de p\\u00e9riodes tactiques. Couverture li\\u00e9e \\u00e0 formation_slots (se remplit avec le load des archives). Source : int_whoscored_lineup.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_whoscored_lineup_agg.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_whoscored_match_index\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_whoscored_match_index\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_whoscored_match_index\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Pont d'identit\\u00e9 entre l'univers WhoScored (ws_match_id, ws_home/away_team_id) et les cl\\u00e9s unifi\\u00e9es (match_id, team_id normalis\\u00e9). Table de r\\u00e9solution d'identit\\u00e9 centrale pour toute la cha\\u00eene \\u00e9v\\u00e9nementielle WhoScored. Grain : une ligne par match. Couvre 2 comp_category : Big5 et D2.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_whoscored_match_index.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_whoscored_players\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_whoscored_players\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_whoscored_players\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Dimension joueur par saison et par \\u00e9quipe \\u2014 grain (player_id, season, team_id canonique). Un transfert en cours de saison = plusieurs lignes. Profil courant height/weight (\\u00e2ge exclu car WhoScored renvoie l'\\u00e2ge du scrape, pas du match). Sources : int_whoscored_player_match, int_whoscored_match_index, silver.stg_whoscored_players_ref.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_whoscored_players.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_whoscored_player_match\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_whoscored_player_match\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_whoscored_player_match\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Stats + note WhoScored par joueur par match, identit\\u00e9s normalis\\u00e9es. Traduit l'id d'\\u00e9quipe WhoScored vers le team_id canonique et rattache le match_id unifi\\u00e9 via int_whoscored_match_index (m\\u00eame logique que int_whoscored_events). player_id reste l'id WhoScored (cl\\u00e9 vers silver.stg_whoscored_players_ref). Source : silver.stg_whoscored_player_match.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_whoscored_player_match.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_whoscored_team_match\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_whoscored_team_match\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_whoscored_team_match\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Stats d'\\u00e9quipe officielles WhoScored par match, identit\\u00e9s normalis\\u00e9es. Conserve stats_json brut (35 m\\u00e9triques par minute) ; extraction des totaux plus tard. Source : silver.stg_whoscored_team_match.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_whoscored_team_match.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_whoscored_team_match_agg\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_whoscored_team_match_agg\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_whoscored_team_match_agg\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Agr\\u00e9gation au niveau match des stats WhoScored \\u2014 grain (match \\u00d7 \\u00e9quipe). Compteurs bruts : SUM() des minutes. Colonnes *_pct : recalcul\\u00e9es depuis les sommes (accurate/total, NULLIF(0) sur le d\\u00e9nominateur), jamais moyenn\\u00e9es depuis le JSON source (cumulatif glissant biais\\u00e9, cf. int_whoscored_team_match_minute). rating exclu (moyenne cumulative glissante, non agr\\u00e9geable). Source : int_whoscored_team_match_minute.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_whoscored_team_match_agg.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_whoscored_team_match_minute\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_whoscored_team_match_minute\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_whoscored_team_match_minute\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Stats d'\\u00e9quipe WhoScored \\u00e9clat\\u00e9es minute par minute \\u2014 grain (match \\u00d7 \\u00e9quipe \\u00d7 minute jou\\u00e9e). Minute au format expanded (45+2 = 47, cf. int_whoscored_formations). Une minute absente d'une m\\u00e9trique dans le JSON source = l'action n'a pas eu lieu \\u2192 0.0 (COALESCE), jamais NULL. Colonnes *_success_value / *_accuracy_value / *_pct_value sont des ratios cumulatifs glissants du JSON source (biais\\u00e9s, cf. rating) \\u2014 ne jamais les sommer ni les moyenner ; recalculer depuis les compteurs bruts (accurate/total) en aval, cf. int_whoscored_team_match_agg. Source : int_whoscored_team_match.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_whoscored_team_match_minute.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_whoscored_team_season\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_whoscored_team_season\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_whoscored_team_season\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Agr\\u00e9gats de saison WhoScored par \\u00e9quipe (d\\u00e9fense, attaque, xG, diff\\u00e9renci\\u00e9s Home/Away), cast\\u00e9s depuis le VARCHAR brut de silver.whoscored_team_season. Agr\\u00e9gats de SAISON COMPL\\u00c8TE : \\u00e0 n'utiliser qu'en saison N-1 (fuite de donn\\u00e9es sinon \\u2014 cf. gold.equipe_match). Couverture : 2019-2020 (Premier League seule), puis 2021-2022 \\u2192 2024-2025 ; 2020-2021 absente. 390 lignes, 0 valeur vide, 0 \\u00e9quipe non mapp\\u00e9e.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_whoscored_team_season.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_xt_actions\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_xt_actions\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_xt_actions\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Actions atomiques pour l'expected threat (xT), affect\\u00e9es \\u00e0 la grille fine 16\\u00d712. Grain : une action de possession (d\\u00e9placement, tir OU perte de balle). L'affectation (x,y)\\u2192case est d\\u00e9finie UNIQUEMENT ici (col/row) et relue telle quelle par xt_grid.py et int_xt_contributions. D\\u00e9placements = passes r\\u00e9ussies (player_passes_raw) + dribbles TakeOn r\\u00e9ussis. Tirs = int_shot_placement, hors CSC. Pertes = fin de possession (passe/dribble rat\\u00e9s, contr\\u00f4le manqu\\u00e9, Dispossessed, OffsidePass) depuis int_event_enriched.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_xt_actions.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_xt_contributions\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_xt_contributions\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_xt_contributions\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Contributions Expected Threat (xT) : xT ajout\\u00e9 par d\\u00e9placement. Grain : 1 ligne par d\\u00e9placement (int_xt_actions action_kind='move' avec destination). xT_ajout\\u00e9 = xT(case d'arriv\\u00e9e) \\u2212 xT(case de d\\u00e9part), attribu\\u00e9 au joueur/\\u00e9quipe ; positif = progression vers le but adverse. Grille lue depuis machine_learning.xt_grid (\\u00e9talon global). Mat\\u00e9rialis\\u00e9 en table.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_xt_contributions.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"player_match_stats\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.player_match_stats\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"player_match_stats\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Agr\\u00e9gats WhoScored par joueur par match. Calcul\\u00e9 depuis int_whoscored_events et events_qual. Structure en trois CTEs : base_agg (m\\u00e9triques g\\u00e9n\\u00e9rales), offensive_agg (passes, tirs, progressions), defensive_agg (tackles, interceptions, d\\u00e9gagements). Utilis\\u00e9 pour les squad features dans gold.features_whoscored.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\player_match_stats.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"player_network_centrality\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.player_network_centrality\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"player_network_centrality\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Centralit\\u00e9 de chaque joueur dans le r\\u00e9seau de passes : degr\\u00e9s entrant et sortant (bruts et pond\\u00e9r\\u00e9s par le volume), passes cr\\u00e9atives/progressives \\u00e9mises et re\\u00e7ues. Source : player_network_passes.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\player_network_centrality.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"player_network_duels\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.player_network_duels\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"player_network_duels\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Apparie les duels adverses via le qualifier 233 (miroir d'\\u00e9v\\u00e9nement) pour relier le joueur A et son vis-\\u00e0-vis B sur le m\\u00eame affrontement. Mati\\u00e8re premi\\u00e8re des duels individuels. Sources : events_qual, int_event_enriched.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\player_network_duels.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"player_network_passes\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.player_network_passes\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"player_network_passes\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Ar\\u00eates du graphe de passes agr\\u00e9g\\u00e9es par (match, \\u00e9quipe, passeur, receveur) : volume total et ventil\\u00e9 par contexte (contre-attaque, open play, recovery, autre), passes progressives/cr\\u00e9atives/buildup. Source : player_passes_raw.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\player_network_passes.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"player_passes_raw\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.player_passes_raw\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"player_passes_raw\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Passes atomiques passeur \\u2192 receveur reconstruites depuis les cha\\u00eenes de possession (LEAD sur les \\u00e9v\\u00e9nements de l'\\u00e9quipe en possession, sans sauter les \\u00e9v\\u00e9nements adverses). Porte les flags is_progressive/is_creative/ is_buildup et le chain_trigger. Brique de base du r\\u00e9seau de passes. Grain : une passe r\\u00e9ussie (type 1, outcome 1, avec receveur).\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\player_passes_raw.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"player_possession_chains\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.player_possession_chains\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"player_possession_chains\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Segmente le flux d'\\u00e9v\\u00e9nements WhoScored en cha\\u00eenes de possession. Pour chaque \\u00e9v\\u00e9nement, d\\u00e9termine l'\\u00e9quipe r\\u00e9ellement en possession (possession certaine vs ind\\u00e9termin\\u00e9e), puis marque le d\\u00e9clencheur de chaque cha\\u00eene via chain_trigger (corner, free_kick, counter_attack, open_play, recovery, throw_in, goal_kick...). Source : int_event_enriched. Incr\\u00e9mentale sur match_id. Brique de base de corner_profiles, player_passes_raw et player_xg_chain. Une ligne par action.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\player_possession_chains.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"player_xg_chain\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.player_xg_chain\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"player_xg_chain\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Attribue une valeur xG (proxy via chance_creation du tir terminal) aux joueurs impliqu\\u00e9s dans une cha\\u00eene se terminant par un tir \\u2014 cr\\u00e9dit offensif r\\u00e9parti sur la cha\\u00eene. Source : player_possession_chains. Incr\\u00e9mentale.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\player_xg_chain.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"player_zone_transitions\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.player_zone_transitions\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"player_zone_transitions\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Compte les transitions de zone (zone_from \\u2192 zone_to) par joueur, ventil\\u00e9es par p\\u00e9riode, \\u00e9tat au score (score_state) et formation. D\\u00e9crit les patterns de circulation du ballon. Source : int_event_enriched (via player_passes_raw pour les passes + TakeOns r\\u00e9ussis). Incr\\u00e9mentale. Grain : (match, \\u00e9quipe, joueur, zone_from, zone_to, p\\u00e9riode, score_state, formation). Les \\u00ab d\\u00e9placements \\u00bb = passes r\\u00e9ussies + dribbles (TakeOn) r\\u00e9ussis.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\player_zone_transitions.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"team_features_ws\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.team_features_ws\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"team_features_ws\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Features tactiques WhoScored par \\u00e9quipe par match. Calcul\\u00e9es depuis silver.stg_whoscored_events et intermediate.events_qual. 32 m\\u00e9triques couvrant le pressing, les zones d'attaque, la structure d\\u00e9fensive.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\team_features_ws.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"team_network_features\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.team_network_features\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"team_network_features\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Agr\\u00e8ge les m\\u00e9triques r\\u00e9seau joueur \\u2192 features d'\\u00e9quipe par match : nombre de joueurs et d'ar\\u00eates actifs, d\\u00e9pendance au top cr\\u00e9ateur (top_creator_share), betweenness moyenne, entropie de Shannon du r\\u00e9seau (network_entropy). Source : player_network_centrality.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\team_network_features.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"threat_conceded\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.threat_conceded\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"threat_conceded\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Sym\\u00e9trique d\\u00e9fensif de player_xg_chain : attribue la menace conc\\u00e9d\\u00e9e sur les cha\\u00eenes adverses termin\\u00e9es par un tir (penalty exclu), pour mesurer la responsabilit\\u00e9 d\\u00e9fensive. Source : player_xg_chain. Incr\\u00e9mentale.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\threat_conceded.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"xgot_features\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.xgot_features\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"machine_learning\", \"table_name\": \"xgot_features\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Socle de features xGOT \\u2014 logique de calcul PARTAG\\u00c9E entre l'entra\\u00eenement (xgot_training) et le scoring (pipelines/xgot_score.py). Un tir cadr\\u00e9 \\u00e9ligible par ligne. P\\u00e9rim\\u00e8tre : tirs cadr\\u00e9s, placement pr\\u00e9sent, hors CSC, hors penalty. D\\u00e9finir features + p\\u00e9rim\\u00e8tre \\u00e0 un seul endroit interdit structurellement le train/serve skew. Vue \\u2192 toujours \\u00e0 jour avec int_shot_placement. Sch\\u00e9ma : machine_learning.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"view\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\machine_learning\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\machine_learning\\\\xgot_features.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"xgot_training\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.xgot_training\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"machine_learning\", \"table_name\": \"xgot_training\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Dataset d'entra\\u00eenement du mod\\u00e8le xGOT (post-shot xG) = xgot_features + label. Un tir cadr\\u00e9 \\u00e9ligible par ligne. Cible = label (le tir finit-il au fond). Toute la logique de features et le p\\u00e9rim\\u00e8tre vivent dans xgot_features (partag\\u00e9 avec le scoring \\u2192 pas de train/serve skew). Pas de filtre saison (protection port\\u00e9e par une barri\\u00e8re de couverture avant l'entra\\u00eenement). Vue \\u2192 toujours \\u00e0 jour. Sch\\u00e9ma : machine_learning.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"view\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\machine_learning\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\machine_learning\\\\xgot_training.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"mart_1n2\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.mart_1n2\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"marts\", \"table_name\": \"mart_1n2\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Mart du mod\\u00e8le 1N2 \\u2014 grain (match_id, team_id). Pure s\\u00e9lection des features match-\\u00e9quipe + cible result_1n2 (H/D/A). result_1n2 est NULL pour les matchs \\u00e0 venir (servis par predict_1n2), d'o\\u00f9 accepted_values plut\\u00f4t que not_null.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\marts\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\marts\\\\mart_1n2.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"mart_assists\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.mart_assists\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"marts\", \"table_name\": \"mart_assists\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Mart passeurs \\u2014 grain (match_id, team_id, player_id). Cible assisted (0/1).\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\marts\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\marts\\\\mart_assists.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"mart_events\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.mart_events\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"marts\", \"table_name\": \"mart_events\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Mart cartons/corners \\u2014 grain (match_id). Cibles total_cards, total_corners. NULLs actuels = couverture compos 2025-26 incompl\\u00e8te \\u2192 not_null en warn.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\marts\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\marts\\\\mart_events.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"mart_goals\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.mart_goals\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"marts\", \"table_name\": \"mart_goals\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Mart buts marqu\\u00e9s \\u2014 grain (match_id, team_id). Cible team_goals.\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\marts\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\marts\\\\mart_goals.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"mart_scorers\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.mart_scorers\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"marts\", \"table_name\": \"mart_scorers\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Mart buteurs \\u2014 grain (match_id, team_id, player_id). Cible scored (0/1, hors csc).\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\marts\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\marts\\\\mart_scorers.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"player_network_betweenness\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.player_network_betweenness\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"player_network_betweenness\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Mod\\u00e8le Python (dbt-python). Calcule la betweenness centrality exacte par (match, \\u00e9quipe) avec networkx sur le graphe pond\\u00e9r\\u00e9 de passes (normalized=True, weight=n_passes). Identifie les joueurs-ponts. Source : player_network_passes.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\player_network_betweenness.py\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"events_qual\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.events_qual\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"events_qual\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\\u00c9clatement des qualifiers de int_whoscored_events (via qualifiers_json) : 1 ligne par (\\u00e9v\\u00e9nement \\u00d7 qualifier). Base de tous les mod\\u00e8les WhoScored. Incr\\u00e9mentale. Les colonnes d'\\u00e9v\\u00e9nement sont reprises telles quelles de int_whoscored_events ; qual_type_id/name/value sont la transformation (unnest).\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\events_qual.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_event_enriched\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_event_enriched\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_event_enriched\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\\u00c9v\\u00e9nements WhoScored enrichis d'un pivot des qualifiers utiles, notamment la hi\\u00e9rarchie chance_creation (leading_to_goal, intentional_assist, big_chance_created, key_pass, shot_assist...). Table socle de event_values, player_possession_chains, player_network_duels et player_zone_transitions. Incr\\u00e9mentale sur scraped_at. Filtre : player_id IS NOT NULL.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_event_enriched.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_whoscored_events\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_whoscored_events\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_whoscored_events\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\\u00c9v\\u00e9nements bruts WhoScored (silver.stg_whoscored_events) avec team_id normalis\\u00e9 et match_id unifi\\u00e9, r\\u00e9solus via int_whoscored_match_index. Point d'entr\\u00e9e de la cha\\u00eene \\u00e9v\\u00e9nementielle. Grain : un \\u00e9v\\u00e9nement.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_whoscored_events.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}]--ELEMENTARY-MACRO-OUTPUT-END--"}, "info": {"category": "", "code": "I062", "extra": {}, "invocation_id": "b4291835-42ab-46b1-bc11-be2a96e99fe0", "level": "info", "msg": "Elementary: --ELEMENTARY-MACRO-OUTPUT-START--[{\"name\": \"scraping_targets_int_fbref_keeper\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.scraping_targets_int_fbref_keeper\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"audits\", \"table_name\": \"scraping_targets_int_fbref_keeper\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Liste des (team, season) \\u00e0 rescraper : lignes de silver.fbref_keeper o\\u00f9 ga_keeper > sota (violation physique). Vue mise \\u00e0 jour \\u00e0 chaque `dbt run`.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"view\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\audits\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\audits\\\\scraping_targets_int_fbref_keeper.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"scraping_targets_int_fbref_shooting\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.scraping_targets_int_fbref_shooting\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"audits\", \"table_name\": \"scraping_targets_int_fbref_shooting\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Liste des (team, season) \\u00e0 rescraper : lignes de silver.fbref_shooting o\\u00f9 standard_gls > standard_sot OU standard_gls > gf (violations physiques A-011). Vue mise \\u00e0 jour \\u00e0 chaque `dbt run`.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"view\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\audits\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\audits\\\\scraping_targets_int_fbref_shooting.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"equipe_adversaire_match\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.equipe_adversaire_match\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"equipe_adversaire_match\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": null, \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\equipe_adversaire_match.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"equipe_confrontation_match\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.equipe_confrontation_match\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"equipe_confrontation_match\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": null, \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\equipe_confrontation_match.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"equipe_confrontation_zone\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.equipe_confrontation_zone\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"equipe_confrontation_zone\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Confrontations zonales pivot\\u00e9es au grain (match_id, team_id) : perspective offensive + d\\u00e9fensive par couloir. Consomm\\u00e9 par les marts.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\gold\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\equipe_confrontation_zone.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"equipe_gardien_match\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.equipe_gardien_match\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"equipe_gardien_match\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Profil de saison d\\u00e9cal\\u00e9 du gardien titulaire rattach\\u00e9 \\u00e0 l'\\u00e9quipe \\u2014 grain (match_id, team_id). Cl\\u00e9s NULL r\\u00e9siduelles = compos manquantes (scraping 2025-26), trac\\u00e9es en warn le temps de compl\\u00e9ter la couverture.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\gold\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\equipe_gardien_match.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"equipe_lineup_match\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.equipe_lineup_match\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"equipe_lineup_match\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": null, \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\equipe_lineup_match.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"equipe_match\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.equipe_match\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"equipe_match\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": null, \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\equipe_match.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"gardien_saison\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.gardien_saison\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"gardien_saison\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": null, \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\gardien_saison.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"joueur_match\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.joueur_match\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"joueur_match\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": null, \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\joueur_match.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"joueur_saison\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.joueur_saison\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"joueur_saison\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": null, \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\joueur_saison.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"joueur_zone_saison\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.joueur_zone_saison\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"joueur_zone_saison\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": null, \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\joueur_zone_saison.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"rolling_corners\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.rolling_corners\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"rolling_corners\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Rolling windows W=3/5/10 sur les corners, depuis intermediate.corner_profiles. 1 ligne par \\u00e9quipe par match \\u2014 \\\"for\\\" (corners obtenus) et \\\"against\\\" (corners conc\\u00e9d\\u00e9s), jointes via intermediate.backbone (team_id / opponent_id). Action dangereuse = corner ayant produit un tir (outcome IN goal/shot_saved/ shot_off_target). Ratio de sommes sur la fen\\u00eatre, pas moyenne de taux par match. Enrichi (Vague 5.4) : intensite de danger continue (xG/corner), profil aerien (tetes sur tirs/buts), tendance corner court, et bataille du degagement defensif.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\gold\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\rolling_corners.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"rolling_freekicks\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.rolling_freekicks\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"rolling_freekicks\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Rolling windows W=3/5/10 sur les coups francs, depuis intermediate.freekick_profiles. 1 ligne par \\u00e9quipe par match \\u2014 \\\"for\\\" (coups francs obtenus) et \\\"against\\\" (conc\\u00e9d\\u00e9s), jointes via intermediate.backbone (team_id / opponent_id). Filtr\\u00e9 sur fk_zone_type IN (crossed, direct_shot) : les coups francs too_far/own_box sont exclus, ils n'ont pas de danger r\\u00e9el et diluent le signal. Action dangereuse = coup franc ayant produit un tir. Ratio de sommes sur la fen\\u00eatre, pas moyenne de taux par match. Enrichi (Vague 5.4) : intensit\\u00e9 de danger continue, profil a\\u00e9rien, bataille du d\\u00e9gagement, r\\u00e9partition tactique par zone (direct/crossed/own_box/too_far, non filtr\\u00e9e) et qualit\\u00e9 de position (distance/angle) des coups francs directs.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\gold\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\rolling_freekicks.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"team_corridor_profile\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.team_corridor_profile\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"team_corridor_profile\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": null, \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\team_corridor_profile.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"zone_confrontation_match\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.zone_confrontation_match\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"gold\", \"table_name\": \"zone_confrontation_match\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": null, \"full_path\": \"models\\\\gold\\\\zone_confrontation_match.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"backbone\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.backbone\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"backbone\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Table pivot centrale \\u2014 1 ligne par \\u00e9quipe par match (base int_fbref_schedule, matchs \\u00e0 venir inclus). Jointure des int_fbref_* (schedule, keeper, shooting, misc), int_understat_stats et int_odds, produite par dbt en mode incremental. Uniquement des faits au grain match : les agr\\u00e9gats de saison WhoScored (grain \\u00e9quipe \\u00d7 saison) sont joints en gold, d\\u00e9cal\\u00e9s en N-1 (cf. gold.equipe_match). Sch\\u00e9ma intermediate \\u2014 consomm\\u00e9e par les mod\\u00e8les gold.* et marts.*. Noms de colonnes pr\\u00e9fix\\u00e9s par type (docs/proposition_nommage_definitif.csv) ; premier run apr\\u00e8s la refonte en --full-refresh.\\nSegmentation Big5-only : - Colonnes Understat (dec_np_xg, dec_ppda, dec_np_xg_diff_match) : 100 % NULL hors Big5 - Colonnes Odds : 100 % NULL hors Big5, avec sparsit\\u00e9 r\\u00e9siduelle en Big5\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\backbone.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"corner_profiles\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.corner_profiles\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"corner_profiles\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Profils de corners. Pour chaque cha\\u00eene d\\u00e9clench\\u00e9e par un corner, caract\\u00e9rise la livraison (end_x/end_y, joueur, via qualifier CornerTaken=6) et l'issue de la s\\u00e9quence. Source : player_possession_chains. Incr\\u00e9mentale.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\corner_profiles.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"event_values\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.event_values\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"event_values\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Valorise chaque \\u00e9v\\u00e9nement individuel via cinq axes ind\\u00e9pendants (danger_position, chance_creation, def_execution_quality, pressure_context, context_weight) combin\\u00e9s en une note globale action_value. Couche \\\"value par action\\\" consomm\\u00e9e par les mod\\u00e8les de cha\\u00eenes. Source : int_event_enriched. Incr\\u00e9mentale (cl\\u00e9 match_id + team_id + player_id + row_num).\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\event_values.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"freekick_profiles\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.freekick_profiles\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"freekick_profiles\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Profils de coups francs par cha\\u00eene. Caract\\u00e9rise chaque coup franc par son type (direct, indirect, short_pass) et son issue (goal, shot_saved, shot_off_target, offside, foul_won, corner_won, open_play, turnover). Source : player_possession_chains. Incr\\u00e9mentale.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\freekick_profiles.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"h2h_history\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.h2h_history\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"h2h_history\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Registre brut des confrontations directes entre \\u00e9quipes. Une ligne par match.\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\h2h_history.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_defensive_blocks\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_defensive_blocks\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_defensive_blocks\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Contres d\\u00e9fensifs au grain \\u00ab un contre \\u00bb, avec le d\\u00e9fenseur qui bloque. Bas\\u00e9 sur l'event type 74 BlockedPass (bloqueur toujours nomm\\u00e9), rattach\\u00e9 \\u00e0 la passe bloqu\\u00e9e via le qual 233 (99,4 %). Ce sont des contres de PASSE ; les contres de tir n'ont pas de bloqueur nomm\\u00e9 chez Opta et sont hors p\\u00e9rim\\u00e8tre. Le join qual 233 contraint l'\\u00e9quipe adverse (event_id scop\\u00e9 par \\u00e9quipe). Source : int_whoscored_events, events_qual.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_defensive_blocks.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_fbref_keeper\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_fbref_keeper\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_fbref_keeper\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Stats gardien FBref (tirs cadr\\u00e9s subis, arr\\u00eats, save%) rematch\\u00e9es sur match_id unifi\\u00e9 et team_id normalis\\u00e9. Colonnes num\\u00e9riques cast\\u00e9es et corrig\\u00e9es depuis le VARCHAR brut : identit\\u00e9 sota = ga_keeper + saves appliqu\\u00e9e quand une seule des trois manque, saves = 0 par convention quand absent, NULL uniquement quand les trois manquent ensemble (~0.4%).\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_fbref_keeper.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_fbref_misc\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_fbref_misc\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_fbref_misc\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Stats disciplinaires et d\\u00e9fensives FBref (cartons, fautes, hors-jeux, centres, interceptions, tacles gagn\\u00e9s, penaltys obtenus/conc\\u00e9d\\u00e9s, CSC) rematch\\u00e9es sur match_id + team_id. Alimente le bloc disciplinaire de backbone. Colonnes cast\\u00e9es depuis le VARCHAR brut de silver.fbref_misc. Stats avanc\\u00e9es (fls, fld, off, crosses, int, tklw) absentes avant 2014-2015 (~24 900 lignes NULL) ; faux z\\u00e9ros FBref neutralis\\u00e9s en NULL (bloc complet 616 lignes, sous-bloc int/tklw). pkwon/pkcon fournis par FBref uniquement de 2014-2015 \\u00e0 2018-2019 (~78 % NULL).\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_fbref_misc.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_fbref_schedule\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_fbref_schedule\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_fbref_schedule\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Feuille de match FBref (r\\u00e9sultat, buts marqu\\u00e9s/encaiss\\u00e9s, possession, formation) rematch\\u00e9e sur match_id + team_id. Source des r\\u00e9sultats bruts et de la possession dans backbone. Couvre toutes les comp\\u00e9titions (Big5, Cup, D2, Europe, Other) \\u2014 pas de segmentation Big5-only. Inclut les matchs non jou\\u00e9s (\\u00e0 venir, report\\u00e9s, annul\\u00e9s COVID 2019-20) : str_result = '', int_gf / int_ga / str_result_1n2 NULL (4 278 lignes).\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_fbref_schedule.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_fbref_shooting\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_fbref_shooting\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_fbref_shooting\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Volume de tirs FBref (tirs totaux, tirs cadr\\u00e9s, ratios d'efficacit\\u00e9) rematch\\u00e9 sur match_id + team_id. Alimente le bloc tirs de backbone. Colonnes cast\\u00e9es depuis le VARCHAR brut de silver.fbref_shooting. Pas de donn\\u00e9es de tirs FBref avant 2014-2015 (19 900 lignes : sh, sot, pkatt et ratios NULL). sh = 0 trait\\u00e9 comme donn\\u00e9e manquante (563 lignes \\u2192 NULL). Ratios recalcul\\u00e9s hors penalty, \\u00e9chelle 0-1.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_fbref_shooting.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_formation_matchup_match\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_formation_matchup_match\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_formation_matchup_match\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Grain (match_id, team_id) directionnel A\\u2192B. Deltas structurels entre la formation de A et celle de l'adversaire B (attack_overload, mid_control_delta, back_depth_delta, width_delta, depth_delta, axiality_delta) + cl\\u00e9 cat\\u00e9gorielle crois\\u00e9e matchup_family (ex. '4-back_vs_3-back'). Compl\\u00e8te le signal individuel d'int_lineup_formation par les effets non-lin\\u00e9aires de matchup formation \\u00d7 formation.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_formation_matchup_match.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_fouls_drawn\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_fouls_drawn\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_fouls_drawn\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Fautes subies (coups francs obtenus) au grain \\u00ab une faute subie \\u00bb : c\\u00f4t\\u00e9 outcome_id=1 des events Foul (type 4). Rattache le fautif via le qual 233 (OppositeRelatedEvent, d\\u00e9terministe 100 %), la localisation (x/y, zone), le tiers offensif (x > 66.7) et si la faute donne un penalty. Le joueur qui subit est NULL ~5 % (limite source). Source : int_whoscored_events, events_qual.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_fouls_drawn.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_keeper_psxg\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_keeper_psxg\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_keeper_psxg\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Post-Shot Expected Goals +/- (PSxG+/-) par gardien = mesure de shot-stopping. Grain : gardien \\u00d7 saison \\u00d7 championnat. Source : int_keeper_shots. psxg_plus_minus = \\u03a3 xGOT subi \\u2212 buts encaiss\\u00e9s ; > 0 = le gardien arr\\u00eate plus que la qualit\\u00e9 des tirs ne le pr\\u00e9dit (surperformance). Garde-fou sym\\u00e9trique : uniquement les tirs des matchs o\\u00f9 def_gk_available (pas d'arr\\u00eat sans but possible). Hors CSC/penalty par construction amont. Mat\\u00e9rialis\\u00e9 en table.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_keeper_psxg.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_keeper_shots\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_keeper_shots\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_keeper_shots\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Attribution du gardien \\u00e0 chaque tir cadr\\u00e9 subi \\u2014 brique de int_keeper_psxg. Grain : un tir cadr\\u00e9 (SavedShot + Goal, hors CSC/penalty), avec son xGOT (machine_learning.xgot_predictions) et le gardien qui l'a subi. Deux voies : tirs arr\\u00eat\\u00e9s \\u2192 Save miroir reli\\u00e9 au tir par le qualifier 233 (related_event_id est NULL) ; buts \\u2192 GK (slot=1) de l'\\u00e9quipe qui d\\u00e9fend, p\\u00e9riode de formation active. keeper_id = COALESCE(save, lineup). Mat\\u00e9rialis\\u00e9 en table.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_keeper_shots.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_lineup_formation\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_lineup_formation\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_lineup_formation\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Grain (match_id, team_id). Features structurelles de la compo de d\\u00e9part (p\\u00e9riode 1) : compteurs par ligne via role_fin_resolved, cat\\u00e9gorie 3/4/5-back via n_def, \\u00e9cart-type spatial du bloc de champ (GK exclu), hauteur moyenne des lignes d\\u00e9fensive/offensive, axialit\\u00e9 du XI. Base de la Phase 4 (features formation) \\u2014 consomm\\u00e9 par int_formation_matchup_match et par equipe_lineup_match.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_lineup_formation.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_odds\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_odds\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_odds\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Cotes bookmakers (Pinnacle et moyennes march\\u00e9) rematch\\u00e9es sur match_id + team_id/opponent_id. Alimente les colonnes odds_* et les probabilit\\u00e9s implicites de backbone.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_odds.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_penalties\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_penalties\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_penalties\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Penaltys au grain \\u00ab un penalty tir\\u00e9 \\u00bb. Pivot = la frappe (types 13/14/15/16 portant qual 9) : tireur, r\\u00e9sultat (marqu\\u00e9/arr\\u00eat\\u00e9/poteau/hors-cadre) et placement (goal_mouth_*). Rattach\\u00e9s en LEFT JOIN : PenaltyFaced (type 58, m\\u00eame instant) \\u2192 \\u00e9quipe qui d\\u00e9fend + gardien ; le foul en double (type 4 + qual 9) \\u2192 joueur qui obtient / conc\\u00e8de, dans une fen\\u00eatre de 300 s avant la frappe. Sources : int_event_enriched, int_whoscored_events, events_qual.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_penalties.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_player_minutes\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_player_minutes\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_player_minutes\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Minutes jou\\u00e9es par joueur et par match, d\\u00e9riv\\u00e9es de la timeline de formation WhoScored (int_whoscored_lineup) \\u2014 \\u03a3 des dur\\u00e9es de segments, minutes expanded (absolues). Base du per-90 en couche Gold. Garde-fous : match_id non NULL (exclut les orphelins D2), segments born\\u00e9s 0..130 (exclut la sentinelle 32767), GREATEST(end-start,0).\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_player_minutes.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_player_role_lag\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_player_role_lag\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_player_role_lag\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Grain (player_id, season). R\\u00f4le tactique dominant du joueur en saison N-1 (SEASON-LAG), calcul\\u00e9 sur ses apparitions comme titulaire (moyenne pond\\u00e9r\\u00e9e par minutes titu de grid_vertical/grid_horizontal, taxonomie 9 : GK, CB, FB, DM, CM, WM, AM, W, ST). NULL possible pour une recrue \\u2192 fallback dans int_player_role_match via role_fin_current.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_player_role_lag.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_player_role_match\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_player_role_match\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_player_role_match\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Grain (match_id, player_id). R\\u00f4le tactique r\\u00e9solu pour le match, cascade : role_fin_lag (SEASON-LAG) \\u2192 role_fin_current (slot du joueur dans la formation initiale de ce match, coord annonc\\u00e9e pr\\u00e9-match, pas de leakage) \\u2192 role_fin_resolved = COALESCE des deux, JAMAIS NULL pour un titulaire. Consomm\\u00e9e par le KNN (famille 11 refonte) et serve_features.py.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_player_role_match.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_player_zone_season\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_player_zone_season\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_player_zone_season\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Agr\\u00e9gat zonal 5\\u00d75 offensif par (joueur, cellule, saison jou\\u00e9e) : part moyenne des touches (grille pct_zX_cY remise en tall) et tirs pris dans la cellule (int_shot_placement binn\\u00e9, CSC exclus). Base de gold.joueur_zone_saison. Scind\\u00e9 + mat\\u00e9rialis\\u00e9 pour contourner un bug du planner DuckDB 1.5.1.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_player_zone_season.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_progressive_carries\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_progressive_carries\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_progressive_carries\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Conduites (dribbles) au grain \\u00ab un dribble r\\u00e9ussi \\u00bb : TakeOn (type 3) r\\u00e9ussis c\\u00f4t\\u00e9 offensif (outcome 1 + qual 286). WhoScored n'a pas d'event carry ; le TakeOn est la seule conduite balle au pied enregistr\\u00e9e. Progression mesur\\u00e9e du dribble jusqu'\\u00e0 la touche suivante du joueur dans la m\\u00eame cha\\u00eene, en m\\u00e8tres (r\\u00e9duction de distance au but). is_progressive = gain \\u2265 5 m. Source : player_possession_chains, events_qual.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_progressive_carries.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_shot_creating_actions\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_shot_creating_actions\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_shot_creating_actions\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Actions cr\\u00e9atrices de tir (SCA) et de but (GCA), standard FBref/StatsBomb. Une ligne par cr\\u00e9dit = (tir, sca_order 1|2) : les 2 actions offensives de l'\\u00e9quipe qui tire, dans la m\\u00eame cha\\u00eene de possession, juste avant le tir (Pass, TakeOn, faute obtenue, tir/rebond). is_gca vrai si le tir est un but. Source : player_possession_chains.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_shot_creating_actions.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_shot_placement\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_shot_placement\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_shot_placement\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Placement de tir au grain \\u00ab un tir \\u00bb \\u2014 base du Post-Shot xG (xGOT). Tirs (types 13/14/15/16) issus de int_event_enriched, avec la g\\u00e9om\\u00e9trie du placement dans le cadre du but (goal_mouth_y/z) d\\u00e9riv\\u00e9e pour les tirs cadr\\u00e9s : zone 3\\u00d73, \\u00e9cart au centre, hauteur, distance normalis\\u00e9e \\u00e0 la lucarne. Le xGOT entra\\u00een\\u00e9 reste en aval ; ce mod\\u00e8le expose les entr\\u00e9es + un xG pr\\u00e9-tir proxy. Sources : int_event_enriched, event_values.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_shot_placement.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_substitutions\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_substitutions\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_substitutions\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Changements au grain \\u00ab un remplacement \\u00bb : joueur qui sort (SubstitutionOff, type 18) appari\\u00e9 \\u00e0 celui qui entre (SubstitutionOn, type 19) par rang au sein du groupe (match, \\u00e9quipe, minute, seconde) \\u2014 g\\u00e8re les changements simultan\\u00e9s. Crois\\u00e9 avec related_player_id (pr\\u00e9sent 27 %) : concordance 99,8 %. sub_number = k-i\\u00e8me changement de l'\\u00e9quipe. Source : int_whoscored_events.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_substitutions.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_understat_schedule\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_understat_schedule\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_understat_schedule\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Calendrier Understat rematch\\u00e9 sur le match_id unifi\\u00e9. 1 ligne par match (point de vue domicile : str_team_id = domicile, str_opponent_id = ext\\u00e9rieur). Conserve str_us_match_id (id Understat d'origine) et produit la correspondance str_us_match_id \\u2194 str_match_id r\\u00e9utilis\\u00e9e par int_understat_stats. P\\u00e9rim\\u00e8tre : Big5 domestique, 2014-2015 \\u2192 2025-2026. Understat ne fournit pas de date : jointure registre sur (saison, championnat, domicile, ext\\u00e9rieur), en retenant la premi\\u00e8re date de la paire (\\u00e9carte les barrages class\\u00e9s dans le m\\u00eame league_source, ex. Spezia-Verona 11/06/2023).\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_understat_schedule.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_understat_stats\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_understat_stats\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_understat_stats\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Stats Understat par match jou\\u00e9 (xPts, npxG, PPDA, deep) rattach\\u00e9es au match_id unifi\\u00e9 via int_understat_schedule (1-1 sur str_us_match_id). Alimente les colonnes xG et pressing de backbone. P\\u00e9rim\\u00e8tre : Big5 domestique. 21 259 lignes = matchs jou\\u00e9s.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_understat_stats.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_whoscored_formations\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_whoscored_formations\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_whoscored_formations\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Timeline tactique par \\u00e9quipe par match, identit\\u00e9s normalis\\u00e9es (team_id canonique + match_id unifi\\u00e9 via int_whoscored_match_index). formation_id reste la cl\\u00e9 vers silver.stg_whoscored_formations_ref. Source : silver.stg_whoscored_formations.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_whoscored_formations.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_whoscored_lineup\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_whoscored_lineup\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_whoscored_lineup\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Composition positionnelle par p\\u00e9riode de formation \\u2014 grain (match \\u00d7 \\u00e9quipe \\u00d7 formation_seq \\u00d7 joueur), une ligne par titulaire (slot 1..11). La position est r\\u00e9cup\\u00e9r\\u00e9e via le slot du joueur (formation_positions[slot]), pas par alignement d'index : robuste aux trous de slot (carton rouge). Identit\\u00e9s normalis\\u00e9es (team_id canonique + match_id unifi\\u00e9 via int_whoscored_match_index). Source : silver.stg_whoscored_formations (pr\\u00e9requis : formation_slots rempli).\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_whoscored_lineup.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_whoscored_lineup_agg\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_whoscored_lineup_agg\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_whoscored_lineup_agg\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Features positionnelles au grain joueur\\u00d7match, agr\\u00e9g\\u00e9es depuis int_whoscored_lineup : position moyenne pond\\u00e9r\\u00e9e par les minutes, slot principal, capitaine, nombre de p\\u00e9riodes tactiques. Couverture li\\u00e9e \\u00e0 formation_slots (se remplit avec le load des archives). Source : int_whoscored_lineup.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_whoscored_lineup_agg.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_whoscored_match_index\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_whoscored_match_index\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_whoscored_match_index\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Pont d'identit\\u00e9 entre l'univers WhoScored (ws_match_id, ws_home/away_team_id) et les cl\\u00e9s unifi\\u00e9es (match_id, team_id normalis\\u00e9). Table de r\\u00e9solution d'identit\\u00e9 centrale pour toute la cha\\u00eene \\u00e9v\\u00e9nementielle WhoScored. Grain : une ligne par match. Couvre 2 comp_category : Big5 et D2.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_whoscored_match_index.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_whoscored_players\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_whoscored_players\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_whoscored_players\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Dimension joueur par saison et par \\u00e9quipe \\u2014 grain (player_id, season, team_id canonique). Un transfert en cours de saison = plusieurs lignes. Profil courant height/weight (\\u00e2ge exclu car WhoScored renvoie l'\\u00e2ge du scrape, pas du match). Sources : int_whoscored_player_match, int_whoscored_match_index, silver.stg_whoscored_players_ref.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_whoscored_players.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_whoscored_player_match\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_whoscored_player_match\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_whoscored_player_match\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Stats + note WhoScored par joueur par match, identit\\u00e9s normalis\\u00e9es. Traduit l'id d'\\u00e9quipe WhoScored vers le team_id canonique et rattache le match_id unifi\\u00e9 via int_whoscored_match_index (m\\u00eame logique que int_whoscored_events). player_id reste l'id WhoScored (cl\\u00e9 vers silver.stg_whoscored_players_ref). Source : silver.stg_whoscored_player_match.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_whoscored_player_match.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_whoscored_team_match\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_whoscored_team_match\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_whoscored_team_match\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Stats d'\\u00e9quipe officielles WhoScored par match, identit\\u00e9s normalis\\u00e9es. Conserve stats_json brut (35 m\\u00e9triques par minute) ; extraction des totaux plus tard. Source : silver.stg_whoscored_team_match.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_whoscored_team_match.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_whoscored_team_match_agg\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_whoscored_team_match_agg\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_whoscored_team_match_agg\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Agr\\u00e9gation au niveau match des stats WhoScored \\u2014 grain (match \\u00d7 \\u00e9quipe). Compteurs bruts : SUM() des minutes. Colonnes *_pct : recalcul\\u00e9es depuis les sommes (accurate/total, NULLIF(0) sur le d\\u00e9nominateur), jamais moyenn\\u00e9es depuis le JSON source (cumulatif glissant biais\\u00e9, cf. int_whoscored_team_match_minute). rating exclu (moyenne cumulative glissante, non agr\\u00e9geable). Source : int_whoscored_team_match_minute.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_whoscored_team_match_agg.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_whoscored_team_match_minute\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_whoscored_team_match_minute\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_whoscored_team_match_minute\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Stats d'\\u00e9quipe WhoScored \\u00e9clat\\u00e9es minute par minute \\u2014 grain (match \\u00d7 \\u00e9quipe \\u00d7 minute jou\\u00e9e). Minute au format expanded (45+2 = 47, cf. int_whoscored_formations). Une minute absente d'une m\\u00e9trique dans le JSON source = l'action n'a pas eu lieu \\u2192 0.0 (COALESCE), jamais NULL. Colonnes *_success_value / *_accuracy_value / *_pct_value sont des ratios cumulatifs glissants du JSON source (biais\\u00e9s, cf. rating) \\u2014 ne jamais les sommer ni les moyenner ; recalculer depuis les compteurs bruts (accurate/total) en aval, cf. int_whoscored_team_match_agg. Source : int_whoscored_team_match.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_whoscored_team_match_minute.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_whoscored_team_season\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_whoscored_team_season\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_whoscored_team_season\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Agr\\u00e9gats de saison WhoScored par \\u00e9quipe (d\\u00e9fense, attaque, xG, diff\\u00e9renci\\u00e9s Home/Away), cast\\u00e9s depuis le VARCHAR brut de silver.whoscored_team_season. Agr\\u00e9gats de SAISON COMPL\\u00c8TE : \\u00e0 n'utiliser qu'en saison N-1 (fuite de donn\\u00e9es sinon \\u2014 cf. gold.equipe_match). Couverture : 2019-2020 (Premier League seule), puis 2021-2022 \\u2192 2024-2025 ; 2020-2021 absente. 390 lignes, 0 valeur vide, 0 \\u00e9quipe non mapp\\u00e9e.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_whoscored_team_season.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_xt_actions\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_xt_actions\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_xt_actions\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Actions atomiques pour l'expected threat (xT), affect\\u00e9es \\u00e0 la grille fine 16\\u00d712. Grain : une action de possession (d\\u00e9placement, tir OU perte de balle). L'affectation (x,y)\\u2192case est d\\u00e9finie UNIQUEMENT ici (col/row) et relue telle quelle par xt_grid.py et int_xt_contributions. D\\u00e9placements = passes r\\u00e9ussies (player_passes_raw) + dribbles TakeOn r\\u00e9ussis. Tirs = int_shot_placement, hors CSC. Pertes = fin de possession (passe/dribble rat\\u00e9s, contr\\u00f4le manqu\\u00e9, Dispossessed, OffsidePass) depuis int_event_enriched.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_xt_actions.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_xt_contributions\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_xt_contributions\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_xt_contributions\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Contributions Expected Threat (xT) : xT ajout\\u00e9 par d\\u00e9placement. Grain : 1 ligne par d\\u00e9placement (int_xt_actions action_kind='move' avec destination). xT_ajout\\u00e9 = xT(case d'arriv\\u00e9e) \\u2212 xT(case de d\\u00e9part), attribu\\u00e9 au joueur/\\u00e9quipe ; positif = progression vers le but adverse. Grille lue depuis machine_learning.xt_grid (\\u00e9talon global). Mat\\u00e9rialis\\u00e9 en table.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_xt_contributions.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"player_match_stats\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.player_match_stats\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"player_match_stats\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Agr\\u00e9gats WhoScored par joueur par match. Calcul\\u00e9 depuis int_whoscored_events et events_qual. Structure en trois CTEs : base_agg (m\\u00e9triques g\\u00e9n\\u00e9rales), offensive_agg (passes, tirs, progressions), defensive_agg (tackles, interceptions, d\\u00e9gagements). Utilis\\u00e9 pour les squad features dans gold.features_whoscored.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\player_match_stats.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"player_network_centrality\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.player_network_centrality\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"player_network_centrality\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Centralit\\u00e9 de chaque joueur dans le r\\u00e9seau de passes : degr\\u00e9s entrant et sortant (bruts et pond\\u00e9r\\u00e9s par le volume), passes cr\\u00e9atives/progressives \\u00e9mises et re\\u00e7ues. Source : player_network_passes.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\player_network_centrality.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"player_network_duels\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.player_network_duels\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"player_network_duels\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Apparie les duels adverses via le qualifier 233 (miroir d'\\u00e9v\\u00e9nement) pour relier le joueur A et son vis-\\u00e0-vis B sur le m\\u00eame affrontement. Mati\\u00e8re premi\\u00e8re des duels individuels. Sources : events_qual, int_event_enriched.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\player_network_duels.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"player_network_passes\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.player_network_passes\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"player_network_passes\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Ar\\u00eates du graphe de passes agr\\u00e9g\\u00e9es par (match, \\u00e9quipe, passeur, receveur) : volume total et ventil\\u00e9 par contexte (contre-attaque, open play, recovery, autre), passes progressives/cr\\u00e9atives/buildup. Source : player_passes_raw.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\player_network_passes.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"player_passes_raw\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.player_passes_raw\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"player_passes_raw\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Passes atomiques passeur \\u2192 receveur reconstruites depuis les cha\\u00eenes de possession (LEAD sur les \\u00e9v\\u00e9nements de l'\\u00e9quipe en possession, sans sauter les \\u00e9v\\u00e9nements adverses). Porte les flags is_progressive/is_creative/ is_buildup et le chain_trigger. Brique de base du r\\u00e9seau de passes. Grain : une passe r\\u00e9ussie (type 1, outcome 1, avec receveur).\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\player_passes_raw.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"player_possession_chains\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.player_possession_chains\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"player_possession_chains\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Segmente le flux d'\\u00e9v\\u00e9nements WhoScored en cha\\u00eenes de possession. Pour chaque \\u00e9v\\u00e9nement, d\\u00e9termine l'\\u00e9quipe r\\u00e9ellement en possession (possession certaine vs ind\\u00e9termin\\u00e9e), puis marque le d\\u00e9clencheur de chaque cha\\u00eene via chain_trigger (corner, free_kick, counter_attack, open_play, recovery, throw_in, goal_kick...). Source : int_event_enriched. Incr\\u00e9mentale sur match_id. Brique de base de corner_profiles, player_passes_raw et player_xg_chain. Une ligne par action.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\player_possession_chains.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"player_xg_chain\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.player_xg_chain\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"player_xg_chain\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Attribue une valeur xG (proxy via chance_creation du tir terminal) aux joueurs impliqu\\u00e9s dans une cha\\u00eene se terminant par un tir \\u2014 cr\\u00e9dit offensif r\\u00e9parti sur la cha\\u00eene. Source : player_possession_chains. Incr\\u00e9mentale.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\player_xg_chain.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"player_zone_transitions\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.player_zone_transitions\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"player_zone_transitions\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Compte les transitions de zone (zone_from \\u2192 zone_to) par joueur, ventil\\u00e9es par p\\u00e9riode, \\u00e9tat au score (score_state) et formation. D\\u00e9crit les patterns de circulation du ballon. Source : int_event_enriched (via player_passes_raw pour les passes + TakeOns r\\u00e9ussis). Incr\\u00e9mentale. Grain : (match, \\u00e9quipe, joueur, zone_from, zone_to, p\\u00e9riode, score_state, formation). Les \\u00ab d\\u00e9placements \\u00bb = passes r\\u00e9ussies + dribbles (TakeOn) r\\u00e9ussis.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\player_zone_transitions.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"team_features_ws\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.team_features_ws\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"team_features_ws\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Features tactiques WhoScored par \\u00e9quipe par match. Calcul\\u00e9es depuis silver.stg_whoscored_events et intermediate.events_qual. 32 m\\u00e9triques couvrant le pressing, les zones d'attaque, la structure d\\u00e9fensive.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\team_features_ws.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"team_network_features\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.team_network_features\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"team_network_features\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Agr\\u00e8ge les m\\u00e9triques r\\u00e9seau joueur \\u2192 features d'\\u00e9quipe par match : nombre de joueurs et d'ar\\u00eates actifs, d\\u00e9pendance au top cr\\u00e9ateur (top_creator_share), betweenness moyenne, entropie de Shannon du r\\u00e9seau (network_entropy). Source : player_network_centrality.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\team_network_features.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"threat_conceded\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.threat_conceded\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"threat_conceded\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Sym\\u00e9trique d\\u00e9fensif de player_xg_chain : attribue la menace conc\\u00e9d\\u00e9e sur les cha\\u00eenes adverses termin\\u00e9es par un tir (penalty exclu), pour mesurer la responsabilit\\u00e9 d\\u00e9fensive. Source : player_xg_chain. Incr\\u00e9mentale.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\threat_conceded.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"xgot_features\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.xgot_features\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"machine_learning\", \"table_name\": \"xgot_features\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Socle de features xGOT \\u2014 logique de calcul PARTAG\\u00c9E entre l'entra\\u00eenement (xgot_training) et le scoring (pipelines/xgot_score.py). Un tir cadr\\u00e9 \\u00e9ligible par ligne. P\\u00e9rim\\u00e8tre : tirs cadr\\u00e9s, placement pr\\u00e9sent, hors CSC, hors penalty. D\\u00e9finir features + p\\u00e9rim\\u00e8tre \\u00e0 un seul endroit interdit structurellement le train/serve skew. Vue \\u2192 toujours \\u00e0 jour avec int_shot_placement. Sch\\u00e9ma : machine_learning.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"view\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\machine_learning\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\machine_learning\\\\xgot_features.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"xgot_training\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.xgot_training\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"machine_learning\", \"table_name\": \"xgot_training\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Dataset d'entra\\u00eenement du mod\\u00e8le xGOT (post-shot xG) = xgot_features + label. Un tir cadr\\u00e9 \\u00e9ligible par ligne. Cible = label (le tir finit-il au fond). Toute la logique de features et le p\\u00e9rim\\u00e8tre vivent dans xgot_features (partag\\u00e9 avec le scoring \\u2192 pas de train/serve skew). Pas de filtre saison (protection port\\u00e9e par une barri\\u00e8re de couverture avant l'entra\\u00eenement). Vue \\u2192 toujours \\u00e0 jour. Sch\\u00e9ma : machine_learning.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"view\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\machine_learning\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\machine_learning\\\\xgot_training.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"mart_1n2\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.mart_1n2\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"marts\", \"table_name\": \"mart_1n2\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Mart du mod\\u00e8le 1N2 \\u2014 grain (match_id, team_id). Pure s\\u00e9lection des features match-\\u00e9quipe + cible result_1n2 (H/D/A). result_1n2 est NULL pour les matchs \\u00e0 venir (servis par predict_1n2), d'o\\u00f9 accepted_values plut\\u00f4t que not_null.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\marts\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\marts\\\\mart_1n2.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"mart_assists\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.mart_assists\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"marts\", \"table_name\": \"mart_assists\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Mart passeurs \\u2014 grain (match_id, team_id, player_id). Cible assisted (0/1).\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\marts\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\marts\\\\mart_assists.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"mart_events\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.mart_events\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"marts\", \"table_name\": \"mart_events\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Mart cartons/corners \\u2014 grain (match_id). Cibles total_cards, total_corners. NULLs actuels = couverture compos 2025-26 incompl\\u00e8te \\u2192 not_null en warn.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\marts\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\marts\\\\mart_events.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"mart_goals\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.mart_goals\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"marts\", \"table_name\": \"mart_goals\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Mart buts marqu\\u00e9s \\u2014 grain (match_id, team_id). Cible team_goals.\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\marts\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\marts\\\\mart_goals.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"mart_scorers\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.mart_scorers\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"marts\", \"table_name\": \"mart_scorers\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Mart buteurs \\u2014 grain (match_id, team_id, player_id). Cible scored (0/1, hors csc).\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\marts\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\marts\\\\mart_scorers.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"player_network_betweenness\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.player_network_betweenness\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"player_network_betweenness\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Mod\\u00e8le Python (dbt-python). Calcule la betweenness centrality exacte par (match, \\u00e9quipe) avec networkx sur le graphe pond\\u00e9r\\u00e9 de passes (normalized=True, weight=n_passes). Identifie les joueurs-ponts. Source : player_network_passes.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"incremental\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\player_network_betweenness.py\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"events_qual\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.events_qual\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"events_qual\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\\u00c9clatement des qualifiers de int_whoscored_events (via qualifiers_json) : 1 ligne par (\\u00e9v\\u00e9nement \\u00d7 qualifier). Base de tous les mod\\u00e8les WhoScored. Incr\\u00e9mentale. Les colonnes d'\\u00e9v\\u00e9nement sont reprises telles quelles de int_whoscored_events ; qual_type_id/name/value sont la transformation (unnest).\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\events_qual.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_event_enriched\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_event_enriched\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_event_enriched\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\\u00c9v\\u00e9nements WhoScored enrichis d'un pivot des qualifiers utiles, notamment la hi\\u00e9rarchie chance_creation (leading_to_goal, intentional_assist, big_chance_created, key_pass, shot_assist...). Table socle de event_values, player_possession_chains, player_network_duels et player_zone_transitions. Incr\\u00e9mentale sur scraped_at. Filtre : player_id IS NOT NULL.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_event_enriched.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_whoscored_events\", \"unique_id\": \"model.football_prediction.int_whoscored_events\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"int_whoscored_events\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"\\u00c9v\\u00e9nements bruts WhoScored (silver.stg_whoscored_events) avec team_id normalis\\u00e9 et match_id unifi\\u00e9, r\\u00e9solus via int_whoscored_match_index. Point d'entr\\u00e9e de la cha\\u00eene \\u00e9v\\u00e9nementielle. Grain : un \\u00e9v\\u00e9nement.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"football_prediction://models\\\\intermediate\\\\schema.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\intermediate\\\\int_whoscored_events.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}]--ELEMENTARY-MACRO-OUTPUT-END--", "name": "JinjaLogInfo", "pid": 27996, "thread": "MainThread", "ts": "2026-09-24T15:11:12.651270Z"}}
