 \\u2014 1 ligne par p\\u00e9riode de formation par \\u00e9quipe. formation_seq = index de la formation dans la liste de l'\\u00e9quipe.\\n\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\sources.yml\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"stg_whoscored_team_match\", \"source_name\": \"silver\", \"unique_id\": \"source.football_prediction.silver.stg_whoscored_team_match\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"silver\", \"table_name\": \"stg_whoscored_team_match\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Faits \\u00e9quipe par match \\u2014 1 ligne par \\u00e9quipe par match. Contexte + 35 m\\u00e9triques \\u00e9quipe officielles (JSON brut par minute).\\n\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\sources.yml\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"stg_whoscored_match_meta\", \"source_name\": \"silver\", \"unique_id\": \"source.football_prediction.silver.stg_whoscored_match_meta\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"silver\", \"table_name\": \"stg_whoscored_match_meta\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"M\\u00e9tadonn\\u00e9es du match \\u2014 1 ligne par match. Arbitre, stade, affluence, scores mi-temps / temps plein.\\n\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\sources.yml\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"stg_whoscored_urls\", \"source_name\": \"silver\", \"unique_id\": \"source.football_prediction.silver.stg_whoscored_urls\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"silver\", \"table_name\": \"stg_whoscored_urls\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Registre de scraping \\u2014 1 ligne par (ws_match_id, url). Statut is_scraped + skip_reason permettent de piloter le prochain run du scraper WhoScored. Table de gouvernance : jamais lue par un mod\\u00e8le dbt en aval.\\n\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\sources.yml\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"team_mapping\", \"source_name\": \"referentiel\", \"unique_id\": \"source.football_prediction.referentiel.team_mapping\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"referentiel\", \"table_name\": \"team_mapping\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Mapping des \\u00e9quipes brutes vers un identifiant canonique. Aliment\\u00e9 run_ingest.py\\n\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\sources.yml\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"match_registry\", \"source_name\": \"intermediate\", \"unique_id\": \"source.football_prediction.intermediate.match_registry\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"intermediate\", \"table_name\": \"match_registry\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Registre central des matchs \\u2014 1 ligne par match physique. Aliment\\u00e9 par upsert depuis 02_process.py via SHA1 sur (date, home_team, away_team, league_source, season). Point de d\\u00e9part de toute la cha\\u00eene features du gold.\\n\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\sources.yml\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"xt_grid\", \"source_name\": \"machine_learning\", \"unique_id\": \"source.football_prediction.machine_learning.xt_grid\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"machine_learning\", \"table_name\": \"xt_grid\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Grille Expected Threat (xT) 16\\u00d712 = 192 cases, estim\\u00e9e par pipelines/xt_grid.py (it\\u00e9ration de valeur / cha\\u00eene de Markov) sur int_xt_actions. \\u00c9talon global stable : une valeur xT par case, croissante vers le but adverse, pic devant la surface. Lue par int_xt_contributions pour le xT ajout\\u00e9 par d\\u00e9placement. R\\u00e9\\u00e9crite (CREATE OR REPLACE) \\u00e0 chaque run.\\n\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\sources.yml\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"xgot_predictions\", \"source_name\": \"machine_learning\", \"unique_id\": \"source.football_prediction.machine_learning.xgot_predictions\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"machine_learning\", \"table_name\": \"xgot_predictions\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"xGOT par tir cadr\\u00e9, \\u00e9crit par pipelines/xgot_score.py (application de models/xgot.joblib \\u00e0 machine_learning.xgot_features). R\\u00e9\\u00e9crite (CREATE OR REPLACE) \\u00e0 chaque run. Lue par int_keeper_shots. Grain : (str_match_id, int_row_num).\\n\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\sources.yml\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"player_style_clusters\", \"source_name\": \"machine_learning\", \"unique_id\": \"source.football_prediction.machine_learning.player_style_clusters\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"machine_learning\", \"table_name\": \"player_style_clusters\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Clusters de style par (str_player_id, str_season), \\u00e9crits par pipelines/03_knn_impute.py (KMeans standardis\\u00e9 sur profil + position, 3 clusters/c\\u00f4t\\u00e9, labels s\\u00e9mantiques ; gardiens = 'GK'). R\\u00e9\\u00e9crite (CREATE OR REPLACE) \\u00e0 chaque run. Pr\\u00e9-restreint le vivier de voisins du KNN et sert de repli. Grain : (str_player_id, str_season).\\n\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\sources.yml\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"zonal_profiles_imputed\", \"source_name\": \"machine_learning\", \"unique_id\": \"source.football_prediction.machine_learning.zonal_profiles_imputed\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"machine_learning\", \"table_name\": \"zonal_profiles_imputed\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Profils zonaux imput\\u00e9s (famille 11), \\u00e9crits par pipelines/03_knn_impute.py. M\\u00eame grain que gold.joueur_zone_saison : les cellules fiables (flag high/medium) sont conserv\\u00e9es, les autres imput\\u00e9es par KNN action-sp\\u00e9cifique (repli cluster). Un flag bool_<feature>_imputed par colonne. R\\u00e9\\u00e9crite (CREATE OR REPLACE) \\u00e0 chaque run. Grain : (str_player_id, str_season, str_zone_5x5).\\n\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\sources.yml\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}]--ELEMENTARY-MACRO-OUTPUT-END--"}, "info": {"category": "", "code": "I062", "extra": {}, "invocation_id": "ea880855-a8f5-46dc-ae0b-7737f49f8f8e", "level": "info", "msg": "Elementary: --ELEMENTARY-MACRO-OUTPUT-START--[{\"name\": \"fbref_schedule\", \"source_name\": \"silver\", \"unique_id\": \"source.football_prediction.silver.fbref_schedule\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"silver\", \"table_name\": \"fbref_schedule\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Table centrale FBref \\u2014 1 ligne par \\u00e9quipe par match (matchs \\u00e0 venir inclus). Point de d\\u00e9part de toute la cha\\u00eene features. Colonnes num\\u00e9riques en VARCHAR brut (cast et validation faits en aval dans int_fbref_schedule, cf. tests d\\u00e9plac\\u00e9s l\\u00e0-bas).\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\sources.yml\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"fbref_keeper\", \"source_name\": \"silver\", \"unique_id\": \"source.football_prediction.silver.fbref_keeper\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"silver\", \"table_name\": \"fbref_keeper\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Statistiques de gardien FBref \\u2014 1 ligne par \\u00e9quipe par match. Colonnes num\\u00e9riques en VARCHAR brut (cast et validation faits en aval dans int_fbref_keeper, cf. tests d\\u00e9plac\\u00e9s l\\u00e0-bas).\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\sources.yml\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"fbref_shooting\", \"source_name\": \"silver\", \"unique_id\": \"source.football_prediction.silver.fbref_shooting\", \"data