92 cases, estim\\u00e9e par pipelines/xt_grid.py (it\\u00e9ration de valeur / cha\\u00eene de Markov) sur int_xt_actions. \\u00c9talon global stable : une valeur xT par case, croissante vers le but adverse, pic devant la surface. Lue par int_xt_contributions pour le xT ajout\\u00e9 par d\\u00e9placement. R\\u00e9\\u00e9crite (CREATE OR REPLACE) \\u00e0 chaque run.\\n\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\sources.yml\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"xgot_predictions\", \"source_name\": \"machine_learning\", \"unique_id\": \"source.football_prediction.machine_learning.xgot_predictions\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"machine_learning\", \"table_name\": \"xgot_predictions\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"xGOT par tir cadr\\u00e9, \\u00e9crit par pipelines/xgot_score.py (application de models/xgot.joblib \\u00e0 machine_learning.xgot_features). R\\u00e9\\u00e9crite (CREATE OR REPLACE) \\u00e0 chaque run. Lue par int_keeper_shots. Grain : (str_match_id, int_row_num).\\n\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\sources.yml\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"player_style_clusters\", \"source_name\": \"machine_learning\", \"unique_id\": \"source.football_prediction.machine_learning.player_style_clusters\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"machine_learning\", \"table_name\": \"player_style_clusters\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Clusters de style par (str_player_id, str_season), \\u00e9crits par pipelines/03_knn_impute.py (KMeans standardis\\u00e9 sur profil + position, 3 clusters/c\\u00f4t\\u00e9, labels s\\u00e9mantiques ; gardiens = 'GK'). R\\u00e9\\u00e9crite (CREATE OR REPLACE) \\u00e0 chaque run. Pr\\u00e9-restreint le vivier de voisins du KNN et sert de repli. Grain : (str_player_id, str_season).\\n\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\sources.yml\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"zonal_profiles_imputed\", \"source_name\": \"machine_learning\", \"unique_id\": \"source.football_prediction.machine_learning.zonal_profiles_imputed\", \"database_name\": \"football_dev\", \"schema_name\": \"machine_learning\", \"table_name\": \"zonal_profiles_imputed\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"football_prediction\", \"description\": \"Profils zonaux imput\\u00e9s (famille 11), \\u00e9crits par pipelines/03_knn_impute.py. M\\u00eame grain que gold.joueur_zone_saison : les cellules fiables (flag high/medium) sont conserv\\u00e9es, les autres imput\\u00e9es par KNN action-sp\\u00e9cifique (repli cluster). Un flag bool_<feature>_imputed par colonne. R\\u00e9\\u00e9crite (CREATE OR REPLACE) \\u00e0 chaque run. Grain : (str_player_id, str_season, str_zone_5x5).\\n\", \"full_path\": \"models\\\\sources.yml\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}]--ELEMENTARY-MACRO-OUTPUT-END--", "name": "JinjaLogInfo", "pid": 27996, "thread": "MainThread", "ts": "2026-09-24T15:11:13.721852Z"}}
